   that I submit some cleanup patches to refamiliarise myself with the 
   process. How many such cleanup patches should I submit? 
   2. Do all patches (cleanup or not) need to be approved by March 12th?
   3. The introduction mentioned that more Linux kernel projects would be 
   announced, but I cannot find them on the Outreachy page for Linux. Am I 
   missing something?
   4. This page <https://kernelnewbies.org/OutreachyTasks> mentions that we 
   should claim a task. At what point should we do that? Should we contact the 
   mentors directly for the same?
   5. May I submit my patches through a different email ID than this one?
   
Thanking you,
